        "title": "Kanan njang Sharon mungai",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kanan njang Sharon mun gai,",
            "Rommei nun rui subao louna;",
            "Kandih hei jing the Sharon baolou khou rui,",
            "Gumliammei maknga puina nunhni rianra,",
            "Rim gaimei Sharon mun baolou khou rui.",
            "",
            "2. Sharon mungai baolou kho rui,",
            "Kakhou lung rianra loumei nun khou;",
            "Lili rui puang lou kaniu lung jingmei khou,",
            "Kaniu rukhou lauthuan ganphiu rui ganguang,",
            "Kaniu bam neilamei mundui rim lik.",
            "",
            "3. Sharon munpuang ganguang datro,",
            "Zeliangrong kandih jingmei khou hei;",
            "Muangrui jinge nangpuan gaimei suliam khang,",
            "Nei rui patna nang puang gaimei ndao o,",
            "Kandihmei rui nang ramgai ta hou khang.",
            "",
            "4. Kanan njang Sharon mungai,",
            "Zeliangrong kandih khou guang datro;",
            "Nban thaini the nangbang nun guai ruina,",
            "Ninga nangta phang the kandih mei guuai rui,",
            "Zeliangrong guai rui ni neila ni the.",
            "",
            "5. He Sharon mun ta hou ni the,",
            "Tingkauh kandih thu puangmei 2!- le;",
            "Siangloumei kross rukhou baolou kanmei 2!-,",
            "Tingkauh tikgun phunga ring dat khou ruina,",
            "Hou mumei pap ta rih sutan puni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
